{
  "_comment": [
    "Single source of truth for how the XCUITest suites are tiered and sharded.",
    "",
    "TIERS",
    "  component  focused: one test drives one feature and asserts on it.",
    "  smoke      broad: one test walks a path that joins several features",
    "             (interaction capture + session context + export + schema).",
    "  soak       leak/perf probes. Not feature tests — nightly only.",
    "",
    "Shards run as parallel jobs against one shared build, so wall-clock is the",
    "SLOWEST shard, not the sum. `seconds` is the measured runtime of the tests",
    "in that shard (GitHub macos-15, run 33612331880) and exists so the packing",
    "can be rebalanced from data rather than guesswork. Keep shards under ~200s.",
    "",
    "Adding a UI test? Add it to a shard here or it will not run in CI.",
    "The tier-coverage check in ci-ui-tests.yml fails the build if a test method",
    "exists in the source but is missing from this file."
  ],
  "shards": [
    {
      "id": "component-gestures",
      "name": "component · gestures",
      "tier": "component",
      "scheme": "DemoAppSwift",
      "seconds": 116,
      "tests": [
        "DemoAppUITests/UserInteractionUITests/testScrollEvents_downAndUp_areCorrectlyCaptured",
        "DemoAppUITests/UserInteractionUITests/testSwipeEvents_leftAndRight_areCorrectlyCaptured"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "component-redaction",
      "name": "component · naming & redaction",
      "tier": "component",
      "scheme": "DemoAppSwift",
      "seconds": 124,
      "tests": [
        "DemoAppUITests/UserInteractionUITests/testResolveTargetName_tapLoginButton_customNameInBackend",
        "DemoAppUITests/UserInteractionUITests/testShouldSendText_sensitiveLabel_noInnerTextInBackend"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "smoke-interaction",
      "name": "smoke · interaction + session",
      "tier": "smoke",
      "scheme": "DemoAppSwift",
      "seconds": 124,
      "tests": [
        "DemoAppUITests/UserInteractionUITests/testAllUserInteractionEvents_combinedSchemaValidation",
        "DemoAppUITests/UserInteractionUITests/testAllInteractionEvents_areAttributedToActiveSession"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "smoke-network",
      "name": "smoke · network + app launch",
      "tier": "smoke",
      "scheme": "DemoAppSwift",
      "seconds": 183,
      "tests": [
        "DemoAppUITests/NetworkInstrumentationUITests/testAllNetworkInstrumentationWithSchemaValidation",
        "DemoAppUITests/DemoAppUITests/testSchemaValidationFlow"
      ]
    },
    {
